<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cricket-West Indies v Pakistan scoreboard.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-West Indies v Pakistan scoreboard.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in the first match of the limited overs World Series final between West Indies and Pakistan at the Sydney Cricket Ground on Saturday.</p>
<p>West Indies  Sherwin Campbell	 b    Shahid Afridi	    52</p>
<p> Junior Murray	    c&amp;b  Mushtaq Ahmed	    48</p>
<p> Brian Lara		 c&amp;b  Shahid Afridi	     0</p>
