<p>Bowling: Wasim Akram 10-0-23-0 (nb-3), Waqar Younis 10-1-43-4 (w-2), Saqlain Mushtaq 10-1-32-0, Mushtaq Ahmed 10-0-40-1, Shahid Afridi 10-0-33-3</p>
